    <briefdescription>
<para>Layout of an AST in a graphicsview (similar to zgrViewer ) </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><image type="html" name="AstGraphView.jpg"></image>
</para><para>This widget shows the AST layouted as a tree. For actual layouting the class <ref refid="classTreeLayoutGenerator" kindref="compound">TreeLayoutGenerator</ref> is used, but this can be replaced easily (for example to use different algorithms, or layout a general graph instead of a tree)</para><para>The actual code for displaying the nodes and edges is implemented in <ref refid="classDisplayTreeNode" kindref="compound">DisplayTreeNode</ref> and <ref refid="classDisplayEdge" kindref="compound">DisplayEdge</ref> </para>    </detaileddescription>
